Usage: build-tool [options] [command]

SharkSpace build, package & publish tool

Options:
  -h, --help                      display help for command

Commands:
  create-dmg [options] [version]  Build SharkSpace and package it as a DMG
  publish [options] <version>     Verify version, create DMG, and publish to npm
  help [command]                  display help for command
